    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Blackjack &amp; Hookers&quot;</strong> a blackjack game with a twist. Compete against ten unique anime girls in intense card battles. As you deal damage, they'll gradually strip down, raising the stakes with each hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468450/extras/60f4fb80713863e033232a1c35f153fb.poster.avif?t=1749645242\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468450/extras/60f4fb80713863e033232a1c35f153fb.webm?t=1749645242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468450/extras/60f4fb80713863e033232a1c35f153fb.mp4?t=1749645242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boobies:</strong> Ten different girls, each with a unique style and personality, are waiting to take you on. As the stakes get higher, watch as they reveal more in this high-tension game</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chip System:</strong> Use chips to strategically influence the game. Each chip has a specific effect that can change the outcome of a round.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability:</strong> Every game is different. Your choices directly impact how the game unfolds, ensuring no two games are the same.</p></li></ul>",
